+  /** Strips the `Inlined(EmptyTree, Nil, realTree)` wrapper every `ExprImpl`
+   *  we construct puts around its tree (see the `Quote`-handling in
+   *  `Splicer.scala`), to compare/match the real underlying tree.
+   */
