+      // `{ ${out}: tpe2 }`, or any other quote-pattern sub-position written
+      // the same way) types as a trivial `Block(Nil, expr)`, wrapping an
+      // otherwise-ordinary shape (`SplicePattern`/`Apply`/... ) that the
+      // cases below already know how to match -- strip it symmetrically
