+   *  `java.lang.reflect.Field` doesn't link without a real JVM behind it --
+   *  same posture as `-Yreporter`'s `getConstructor` (see Driver.scala).
+   *  Unlike GraalVM native-image (which at least has a per-build
+   *  registration escape hatch, worked around here historically by catching
+   *  its `MissingReflectionRegistrationError` by class name), there is no
+   *  registration mechanism to catch a failure from at all -- the call
+   *  simply can't be made. Both callers already document their own graceful
