+  /** For a real host object `v` (not one of our own interpreted wrappers) and
+   *  a concrete class `cls` of the standard library: whether `v`'s class is
+   *  `cls` or a subclass, by walking the superclass chain by name. `None` when
+   *  that can't be decided this way (traits, unknown classes, no reflection).
